WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.593 --> 00:00:15.022
Zann pried a rock loose with his shovel.

2
00:00:15.042 --> 00:00:21.167
"I assumed they'd let me stop working when they saw that big piece of crumblestone," he thought tiredly.

3
00:00:21.707 --> 00:00:25.190
Instead Krub and the goon had told him to keep digging.

4
00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:29.033
Now they were lounging nearby, sipping from their flasks.

5
00:00:29.853 --> 00:00:32.776
Finally Krub came over to see what Zann was doing.

6
00:00:33.524 --> 00:00:36.665
"There's no more crumblestone here," Krub said.

7
00:00:36.685 --> 00:00:40.766
"Crawl through to the next chamber and dig there for a while.

8
00:00:41.366 --> 00:00:44.687
We'll check on you soon, so don't slack off."

9
00:00:45.487 --> 00:00:48.608
Zann had to get on his hands and knees to fit through the tunnel.

10
00:00:49.008 --> 00:00:49.848
But he didn't mind.

11
00:00:50.429 --> 00:00:52.289
At least he'd get a break from the two men.

12
00:00:53.089 --> 00:00:55.850
The next chamber was long, with a low ceiling.

13
00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.151
A short, wiry man was chipping away at the wall.

14
00:00:59.171 --> 00:01:01.311
"Hello." Zann greeted him.

15
00:01:01.331 --> 00:01:03.092
"Do you mind if I dig too?"

16
00:01:03.952 --> 00:01:04.933
"Be my guest."

17
00:01:05.693 --> 00:01:06.853
The man peered at him.

18
00:01:06.873 --> 00:01:10.915
"Hey, you're the kid I saw doing magic earlier.

19
00:01:10.935 --> 00:01:14.957
You pulled a whole chunk of stone out of thin air!"

20
00:01:14.977 --> 00:01:17.978
"What?" Zann was alarmed.

21
00:01:18.498 --> 00:01:21.099
He didn't think anyone had seen him create the crumblestone.

22
00:01:21.119 --> 00:01:24.061
"Don't worry, I won't tell your bosses."

23
00:01:26.061 --> 00:01:28.282
The man leaned closer and lowered his voice.

24
00:01:28.302 --> 00:01:31.904
"Especially if you tell me how you did it."

25
00:01:32.904 --> 00:01:33.864
Zann was relieved.

26
00:01:34.405 --> 00:01:34.845
"Of course.

27
00:01:35.265 --> 00:01:36.566
Magic should be for everyone.

28
00:01:37.066 --> 00:01:37.966
I'm happy to teach you."

29
00:01:38.747 --> 00:01:42.408
Zann showed the man how to create friction by rubbing his hands together.

30
00:01:42.428 --> 00:01:44.549
"That's basically all you need to do.

31
00:01:45.309 --> 00:01:47.410
Then you can create anything, even food.

32
00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:49.431
Use a focusing word to start with.

33
00:01:49.951 --> 00:01:53.913
Cookie!" A wiggle root cookie appeared in Zann's hand.

34
00:01:54.553 --> 00:01:56.154
The man stared in awe.

35
00:01:56.174 --> 00:02:01.456
"Amazing!" "Now you try it," Zann said with a smile.

36
00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:04.790
"Just think of your favorite food as you create friction."

37
00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:08.191
The man successfully created a sandwich.

38
00:02:10.633 --> 00:02:12.574
Then he made himself new boots.

39
00:02:13.394 --> 00:02:17.316
Finally Zann showed him how to zap from one place to another.

40
00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:23.980
"You're doing great," Zann said as the man zapped from the far end of the cavern back to

41
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.020
where Zann was waiting.

42
00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.043
"Keep practicing, and soon you'll be doing all kinds of magic."

43
00:02:29.063 --> 00:02:31.464
"Okay," the man said.

44
00:02:32.008 --> 00:02:34.590
"Now show me how I can punish my enemy."

45
00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:37.392
"What?" Zann said, surprised.

46
00:02:38.052 --> 00:02:39.573
The man's expression darkened.

47
00:02:39.593 --> 00:02:44.677
"Another miner poached a valuable vein of glowstone from me last week.

48
00:02:45.477 --> 00:02:48.199
But he's twice my size, so I couldn't fight him for it.

49
00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.421
I want to punish him!

50
00:02:51.061 --> 00:02:52.542
How can I do that with magic?"

51
00:02:53.523 --> 00:02:54.463
Zann was alarmed.

52
00:02:54.483 --> 00:02:56.965
"That's not how magic is supposed to be used!

53
00:02:57.465 --> 00:03:00.888
The main law in my world is 'do no harm to others.'"

54
00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:02.840
The man rolled his eyes.

55
00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.281
"Your world sounds boring, kid.

56
00:03:05.701 --> 00:03:07.882
That guy harmed me by stealing my vein.

57
00:03:08.702 --> 00:03:10.443
Why shouldn't I harm him back?

58
00:03:10.763 --> 00:03:11.843
He deserves it!"

59
00:03:12.763 --> 00:03:13.664
Zann shook his head.

60
00:03:13.684 --> 00:03:14.604
"I'm sorry.

61
00:03:14.904 --> 00:03:15.524
I can't help you."

62
00:03:15.544 --> 00:03:18.425
"Can't, or won't?"

63
00:03:19.145 --> 00:03:20.465
The man glared at him.

64
00:03:20.485 --> 00:03:26.907
"If you won't teach me what I want to know, maybe I won't keep quiet about the magic

65
00:03:26.947 --> 00:03:27.608
you've been doing.

66
00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.521
I'm sure your bosses would love to hear about it."

67
00:03:32.842 --> 00:03:35.203
Zann gulped, not sure what to do.

68
00:03:36.004 --> 00:03:39.466
Luckily, at that moment, two other miners entered the chamber.

69
00:03:40.246 --> 00:03:45.529
Still, Zann knew he had to do something to stop the first man from talking to Krub.

70
00:03:45.549 --> 00:03:47.870
"Um, okay," he whispered.

71
00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:52.012
"Meet me in the woods by the crooked tree at midnight, and I'll teach you what you need

72
00:03:52.052 --> 00:03:52.413
to know."

73
00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:56.595
For the rest of the day, he couldn't stop thinking about the encounter.

74
00:03:57.175 --> 00:03:58.276
What was he going to do?

75
00:03:59.848 --> 00:04:02.869
"That man will be looking for me at midnight," Zann thought.

76
00:04:02.889 --> 00:04:05.209
"And I'll be at the camp, shackled!

77
00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:08.090
Maybe Perda and Mellis will arrive before then.

78
00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:09.731
Then we can escape together."

79
00:04:10.851 --> 00:04:14.092
But as night fell, there was still no sign of his friends.

80
00:04:14.752 --> 00:04:16.853
Krub and the goon camped in the clearing.

81
00:04:17.353 --> 00:04:20.494
They invited some other miners to share their smelly beverage.

82
00:04:21.034 --> 00:04:23.934
As the evening passed, the men drifted off to sleep.

83
00:04:24.495 --> 00:04:26.355
Krub forgot to shackle Zann.

84
00:04:26.375 --> 00:04:27.635
"What luck!"

85
00:04:28.136 --> 00:04:29.236
Zann thought with relief.

86
00:04:29.836 --> 00:04:32.037
He thought about zapping back to Vilkor's village.

87
00:04:32.597 --> 00:04:37.359
Then he remembered Perda's words again: "Look for other wormholes!"

88
00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.260
He glanced into the dark woods.

89
00:04:41.161 --> 00:04:43.282
The crooked tree wasn't far away.

90
00:04:43.942 --> 00:04:46.023
Was that a wormhole he'd seen earlier?

91
00:04:46.523 --> 00:04:47.683
He decided to find out.

92
00:04:47.703 --> 00:04:53.166
"If the others do show up here, we can escape back to Magica," he thought as he sneaked

93
00:04:53.226 --> 00:04:57.287
away. "My parents and Boz can help us figure out what to do after that."

94
00:04:58.308 --> 00:05:01.929
Soon he spotted the crooked tree looming ahead in the darkness.

95
00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:05.251
Seeing it reminded him of his arrangement with the miner.

96
00:05:05.911 --> 00:05:07.872
How long did he have until midnight?

97
00:05:08.552 --> 00:05:10.893
And what would he do if the man showed up early?

98
00:05:11.434 --> 00:05:12.694
The thought made him nervous.

99
00:05:12.714 --> 00:05:16.596
"Just focus on checking for that wormhole," he told himself.

100
00:05:17.316 --> 00:05:20.658
He stepped past the crooked tree into the small clearing beyond.

101
00:05:21.338 --> 00:05:25.120
Zann stepped closer to the shimmer, and a wormhole swirled open!

102
00:05:26.112 --> 00:05:29.195
He stared into the swirling depths with amazement.

103
00:05:29.775 --> 00:05:34.479
All he had to do was step closer, and the wormhole would pull him into the vortex.

104
00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.962
"Maybe I should go now, on my own," he thought.

105
00:05:37.982 --> 00:05:41.805
"That way I won't have to worry about the miner or anything else.

106
00:05:42.606 --> 00:05:45.989
I can find my way back to Magica and ask the adults to help save Perda and the

107
00:05:46.089 --> 00:05:48.231
others." He took another step.

108
00:05:49.091 --> 00:05:50.352
Then he stopped.

109
00:05:50.873 --> 00:05:54.416
He couldn't abandon Zing or his friends, especially Perda.

110
00:05:55.008 --> 00:05:59.131
Besides, she had mentioned that Terrica wasn't in any of his parents' books.

111
00:05:59.971 --> 00:06:01.672
What if he couldn't find his way back here?

112
00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:06.075
The wormhole continued to swirl, almost hypnotizing Zann.

113
00:06:09.557 --> 00:06:12.379
He snapped out of it when someone cleared his throat nearby.

114
00:06:12.979 --> 00:06:13.699
It was the miner.

115
00:06:13.719 --> 00:06:17.542
"Hello, kid," he said with a nasty smile.

116
00:06:17.562 --> 00:06:20.784
"I'm ready for my lesson now."
